  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "数月前，与整合运动接洽后\n10:14  P.M.    天气/晴\n乌萨斯，无名城郊荒漠"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你和整合运动的领袖们都见过了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感觉如何？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你问我，还是问她？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "问我的话，我只能说不出所料。差不多就该是这些家伙，来做这些事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很奇特。有被刻意引导而推上那个位置而变得残暴的小孩，也有坚韧到超乎想象的战士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有很了不起的家伙，但也有很无趣的反派。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总的来说呢，打了那么多年仗，我们见得也不少了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，有个人倒是让我很在意......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊，你说那个啊。一直和另一个小兔子待在一边的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们的队伍给人的感觉和其他感染者完全不同。这种萨卡兹战士才算得上是战争的符号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨卡兹？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但也很少能见到那样的萨卡兹啊，而且他自称乌萨斯人，也早就和卡兹戴尔断了联系。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真可怜啊，他本可以不用活得这么疲惫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许我们都该见见他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他给人留下的感觉，超过了“战士”这个范畴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你啊，不是总喜欢想很多吗？比起干想，不如去找他那种人聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊内丝",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_052",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们也许都能从他身上学到不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们说的是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "打扰，我想，单独见见你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......真是说来就来，你赶好的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，是谁，暂且，不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，我并非，以领袖的名义，来见你们，请放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是想，来听一听......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "同胞，和家乡，发生的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，在卡兹戴尔，发生了，许多事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，有所耳闻，却不知详情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是个乌萨斯人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这两者，并不冲突。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "血脉，从未改变。黑暗，根深蒂固。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我虽从未在意，但也都，无法动摇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么就算你知道了，又打算做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都已经是很久以前的事情了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不会，做什么，也不能，做什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，在很久以前，我见过，特蕾西娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——嚯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们的反应，我明白。她也在你们这，留下了痕迹。毕竟，你们也是，萨卡兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "泥泞的，也好，血腥的，也罢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她是英雄，至少，被如此推崇。她，伟大的战士，也是，难得的君主。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的血肉，忠于乌萨斯，我的族群，自我流放，但我，还是萨卡兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想知道，她的，卡兹戴尔，发生了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是，想要知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "现在，切尔诺伯格转移途中\n5:22  A.M.    天气/晴\n切尔诺伯格，萨卡兹佣兵驻扎区"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你找我有事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们希望萨卡兹雇佣兵队伍能给出一个解释。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先是有你的队伍叛逃，而前去追击的人汇报说，你根本没有全力以赴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "数个小时前，又有敌人潜伏进切尔诺伯格，同样是你们的失职。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再加上最早攻占切尔诺伯格的时候，有人报告你放走了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，好了好了，我明白客户的不满了，能少说两句吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们只是“合作”关系，现在我是领袖，如果我现在拍桌子翻脸，塔露拉会高兴吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还是爱国者老爷子让你们产生了......整合运动真的精于战争的错觉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要搞错到底是哪些人才能为你们带来胜利。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想明白了就赶紧滚回去，告诉那个龙女，她该知道的事情我会去找她的，不要这么着急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就在刚刚，城内发现了潜入的敌军残党。萨卡兹雇佣兵伊内丝，与对方交火后同归于尽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合运动也参与了这场阻击战，敌人很强，我们都遭到了损失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这都是你的失职所致。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......别这么急着咄咄逼人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才，似乎东边有些动静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......尸体呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很遗憾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我问的是敌人的尸体，伊内丝可不会什么夸张的杀伤性法术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的术师也参加了战斗，整条街道都毁于一旦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你们这也太明目张胆了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道你在说什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那在你们看来，这件事应该怎么处理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们的主要兵力正着眼于将要在龙门发生的战斗，无暇顾及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "领袖暂时不会深究你的责任。你们应该自行处理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......你的乌萨斯口音很重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所以呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......该不会真觉得，随便找个借口就行了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W，停下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（把你手里的遥控法杖放下，冷静。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "抱歉，稍微有点激动，当然你也可以先松口气，庆幸自己捡回一条命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你这是什么意思！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......别误会，死一个萨卡兹并不会对接下来的作战产生什么影响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死一个整合运动，也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你不信，大可以亲自试一试。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我会把你的态度如实转告领袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有下一次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你都听到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从你放过罗德岛的那支队伍开始，整合运动就从来不会让我们单独行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他们真能把这种谨慎全部放在正面战场，也不至于打的这么惨吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使这样你还是故意放跑了背叛的刀术师。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我可没有故意放走他，我只是不想让那些蠢货感染者杀掉我自己带过来的萨卡兹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......如果是以前，你会毫不犹豫地杀了炎客，用他的性命蒙蔽整合运动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论你到底想要什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么？原来只有我记不住他的代号？那不是很尴尬？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊内丝刚才真的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先别提她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她......我会让人去确认的，确认她的......嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先说正事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......三件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一，伊内丝要提醒你，塔露拉的情况不对。她看到的肯定更加具体，但我不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她只说过，塔露拉似乎有“两个影子”。从她的反应来看，这并不是普通法术干扰的结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么每次都不把话说清楚，这个胆小鬼真是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第二，老爷子动身了，奉命去取一件东西。塔露拉根本没有打算隐瞒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......第三，信使已经出发前往维多利亚，很快，摄政王就会知道这里发生的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特雷西斯知道的东西很多很多，他身边的怪物同样不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果让他搅局，这就不光是整合运动和乌萨斯之间这么简单的问题了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W！你在听吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......吵死了，既然全是喜讯，就先让我安静一会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从进门开始......你的手就按在刀柄上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们第一次见面的时候，你就是这样，好像随时准备拔刀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你刚才冷静的就像是爱国者那样——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实你是怎么想的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这不重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们都一样啊，深谙此道，陋习难改。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊内丝她......."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她说的话，我权且记一下吧，为了尊重她的牺牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你们很像，做事从来不会考虑后果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "摄政王不会坐视这边失去控制，如果不能给他合适的答案，伦蒂尼姆的传唤会毁掉你精心准备好的一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讽刺的是，我到现在都不知道你到底想做什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......谁知道呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要觉得自己真的能处理一切，W，你迟早会后悔的，像我一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你有发问的权利，是你避开了漩涡的中央。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吗？那么现在的罗德岛上具体有哪些人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......为什么这么问？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看过你和信使的联络，你一直在调查罗德岛号的踪迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这家制药公司......本以为只是和那场战争稍有牵连，现在看来，根本没那么简单。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特别是，Scout和......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......切尔诺伯格的阻击战我们都负责了别的战场，按照你的规划。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错啊，你们做得很好——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但还是有人看见他了，巴别塔的亡灵。你选择自己去找他，然后放走了他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放在过去，我会把这视作一次不信任的信号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过看样子，你也没打算瞒多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，这种事情还用瞒吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要正面打上两架，那些过去在战场上小有名气的人，自然能认出对面是何方神圣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟那些人还实实在在地活着，这也是没办法的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要打算怎么做？和他们发生冲突本来就完全是意料之外的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果罗德岛这家制药公司真的还是凯尔希做主，也许会是个突破口......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你以为我的目的是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们会帮我做成这件事，上次说好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失信的雇佣兵和死掉的雇佣兵在价值上是等同的，我不介意进行一些额外处理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊内丝已经做不到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而接下来......我也必须离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这我可没听说过，去哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会和信使一起回维多利亚，三四个月的路程，我们明早日出前就要出发。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你是急着和伊内丝殉情吗？以你的身份，背着渎职之罪，去伦蒂尼姆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你逃回卡兹戴尔的下场可能都会更好些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你把加尔森杀了，还重组了雇佣兵，这件事必须有人汇报给摄政王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果没有人回去述职，他会把我们所有人都当做弃子，或者，把我们投入下一处战场，他伸手可及的战场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到了那个时候，才是真的无处可逃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你冒着生命风险为我打掩护？为什么要这么做？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西娅殿下她......记得我的名字。还有我的家族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下已经不在了，不过，还是在这个糟糕的队伍里留下了点什么的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我怎么没有发现？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。无论有些萨卡兹的手段和性格多么扭曲，从结果来看，都还在为那个不现实的想法而战。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你真的知道自己在说什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们认识很久了，W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么出于情面，我也好心提醒你一句。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在是你逃离卡兹戴尔最好的机会，离开这里，绕过龙门和乌萨斯，去更远的地方，我可以睁一只眼闭一只眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但如果回去，你就会死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵......刚才你还说，我必须要帮你做成这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你们帮我的方法都只是送死的话，建议你们把这条命留着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至少该索取的时候，让我还有债可讨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "未必是送死，根据摄政王的态度，事情会有很多种走向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合运动这件事被某些远超你我想象的东西操纵了，摄政王也许会改变他的主意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......何况现在，我已经没有逃走的余裕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "离开卡兹戴尔，再离开这里，又能怎么样？爱国者已经教给我够多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么短的时间里，你被他影响很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么短的时间里，你也被特蕾西娅影响很多，不都一回事吗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特雷西斯高居王位，就算只能跪在黑铁映照的地板上，我也要抵达他的王座，揣摩他的念想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不然，我们继续这样鲁莽行事，才叫送死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实你也可以选择归顺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的确这么想过。你要知道，加尔森一直在怀疑你，他下过命令，让我杀了你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔？你要是听他的，那可能还更有意思一些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，你觉得有意思的东西，我大都觉得没什么意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在，决定吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......我也的确很好奇特雷西斯到底在玩什么把戏......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过似乎我也没什么选择。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错，就算你拒绝我的提案，我也不打算继续让你把控一切事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你该不会说是为了我好吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然不会，哪有处处照顾他人的萨卡兹呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你变回过去的样子了，真无聊。我以为你会就这么沉沦下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么，你已经有计划了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你去问伊内丝吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个笑话一点都不好笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那么临行前，就再多说个笑话吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伊内丝之前说过，你看上去变得越来越像个疯子，手段和性格却越来越优柔寡断。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——我？你自己信吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是最近炸弹用少了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也许吧。你藏的再好，我们也共事太多年了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说不定，其实我们一直都很信任你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_046",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......到底哪句算是笑话？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是你？萨卡兹雇佣兵，赫德雷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听说你要离开这里，那找我们还有什么事吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在出发之前，我有一些事情想要确认一下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们有谁亲眼看见伊内丝战死了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——没有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们接到请求支援的讯号时，战斗就已经结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "街道被大面积损毁，天灾留下的源石结晶裸露地表，产生了剧烈的连锁反应。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只付出了几人的代价就解决了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你干了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "乌萨斯人，看到同伴在面前倒下，你的反应很冷静。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你身上有熟悉的味道，阴谋的味道，战火的味道——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果伊内丝还能站在这里，她一定会这么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原来如此，因为失去战友而迁怒于感染者，这种事情并不少见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才的事，让我以为你会比W聪明一点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，现在回想起来，有点太照顾她了，一直都是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过也不光是为了怕她惹上麻烦，更多的，还是为了亲自动手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_047",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "毕竟我也是个萨卡兹......而且货真价实。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动士兵",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "aliases": [
        "整合运动士兵"
      ]
    }
  ]
